---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Beige Box Support"
      description="Help with Beige Box: purchases, files, web browsing and the BeigeNet bulletin board."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main id="main">
      <article class="policy tile">
        <h1>Beige Box support</h1>
        <p>Five little computers from earlier eras, in your pocket.</p>
        <p>
          Need help? Email
          <a href="mailto:randyventures06@gmail.com?subject=Beige%20Box">randyventures06@gmail.com</a>.
          Include your device, your iOS version, which computer you were using, and what happened.
          Please do not send passwords or payment-card details.
        </p>

        <h2>Restore your unlock</h2>
        <p>
          Connect to the internet and tap Restore on the unlock screen. Use the Apple Account that
          bought the unlock, or a Family Sharing member's account. No separate app account is needed.
          Restoring brings back access to the computers, not deleted files.
        </p>

        <h2>Find your files</h2>
        <p>
          Everything you save in Write, Paint or BASIC is a real file on your device. Open My Disk on
          any computer, or open the Files app and go to On My iPhone (or On My iPad) › Beige Box. All
          five computers share the same disk.
        </p>

        <h2>Keep a copy of a file</h2>
        <p>
          In My Disk, select a file and choose Export to send it anywhere through the share sheet. You
          can also copy files from the Files app. Deleting a file in My Disk cannot be undone, and
          deleting the app removes its files. There is no cloud backup run by this app.
        </p>

        <h2>Web pages look odd or will not load</h2>
        <p>
          Surf displays live websites inside the four desktop computers. HOMEROOM 82 shows pages
          as text, and STUDIO 86 uses grayscale. Some websites restrict embedded browsers or require
          sign-in before playing video. Check your connection and try again. Use
          a regular browser for banking, payments, or anything important.
        </p>

        <h2>Play the new games</h2>
        <p>
          In Breakwater, drag on the playfield or use Left/Right or A/D to move the paddle. Space
          launches the ball; Play pauses or resumes. Clear three walls before losing three lives.
          In Pairs, choose two cards at a time and find all six matches in as few moves as possible.
          Both games save personal records on your device. New or New deal starts over.
        </p>

        <h2>Where did my bulletin board posts go?</h2>
        <p>
          BeigeNet is currently a local demonstration on your device. Posts you write are not shared
          with anyone and are cleared when the app is fully closed.
        </p>

        <h2>Purchases and refunds</h2>
        <p>
          The unlock is one payment, not a subscription. Apple handles payments and refund requests.
          Use <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/">Apple's refund request page</a> for a
          purchase refund. A confirmed refund ends paid access without deleting your files.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://randyventures.com/beigebox/privacy/">Privacy policy</a> ·
          <a href="https://randyventures.com/beigebox/terms/">Terms</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
